-- Priority Config:
-  | IRQ | Priority | Handler | Budget (us) |
-  |-----|----------|---------|-------------|
-  | TIM1_UP | 0,0 | ctrl_loop | <10 |
-  | DMA1_CH5 | 1,0 | data_acq | <50 |
-  | USART1 | 2,0 | uart_rx | <100 |
-- Buffer Strategy: [single/double/ring] size=____
